+
+    /// The market filled, the parents each identifier names filled, the
+    /// cross codes in step, then the identity the instant, the place, the
+    /// cross hash and the content code derive. The content code is the
+    /// source's where the message holds one - the FIX digest of the wire a
+    /// parse settled, the XXH3 of the body a line states - and
+    /// [`Self::digest_content`] only where it holds none, so a message a
+    /// walk re-keys or a registry fills keeps the code its source gave it
